    "page1.html": {
      "settings": {
        "title": "Experience",
        "order": 2
      },
      "components": [
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".text-wrapper": {
                "padding": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".image-wrapper": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
            },
            "img": {
              "width": "100%"
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
              ".text-wrapper": {
                "padding": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_name": "image2",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"image2\" group=\"Images & Videos\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDescription\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/solar-wind-784x540.png\" parallax selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bw-wh-headshot-edit-1723-818x545.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style mt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n                        Image Description</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg' : !fullWidth, 'col-lg-4' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth >= 6, 'col-lg-6' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth <= 5}\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Career Experience</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                        Renewable Energy Executive | Operations | Field Services | Asset Management | P&amp;L<br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "image2-38",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_cid": "upRBRXRb68",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "position": "relative",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".card .card-header": {
              "background-color": "transparent",
              "margin-bottom": "0"
            },
            "a.panel-title": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "&:focus": {
                "text-decoration": "none !important"
              }
            },
            "h6": {
              "font-weight": "700",
              "margin-bottom": "0"
            },
            ".mbr-iconfont": {
              "padding-right": "1rem",
              "font-family": "'Moririse2' !important",
              "font-size": "1.4rem !important",
              "color": "@primaryColor"
            },
            "H3": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "H4": {
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content17",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"content17\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background':bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-head align-center\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b><a href=\"https://www.enelgreenpower.com/countries/north-america\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Enel Green Power North America</a></b></h3>\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mb-0 mt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">Jan-2021 to Mar-2024</h4>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"bootstrap-toggle\" class=\"toggle-panel accordionStyles tab-content mt-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    Associate Vice President, Wind Operation &amp; Maintenance ... (Sep-2022 to Mar-2024)</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">As Associate Vice President, I led a 280-person cross-functional organization encompassing field operations, technical support, operational excellence, and site support departments. This organization included directors, managers, and technicians responsible for overseeing Enel's 7.5 GW wind fleet across the United States and Canada. Key responsibilities included ensuring the safe and profitable production of energy while adhering to all regulatory guidelines. This role involved managing a budget of $250 million, with a target of $320 million in energy sales revenue and $40 million in field services revenue.&nbsp;<br><br>• Guided organization of 280 professionals through downsizing, restructuring, and fostering mindset conducive to efficient operations, achieving zero safety incidents throughout 2023.\n<br>•\tPioneered and executed cost-saving initiative, leading to an 11% decrease in cash expenditure.\n<br>•\tReduced insurance claim processing time by 80%, resulting in $9M in recoveries to the bottom line.<br> • Accelerated the roll-out of the global core operations &amp; maintenance system resulting in an improved adoption rate of the tool.<br>• Established technician career program allowing the technicians a clear progression roadmap to reduce attrition by staying competitive in the market.&nbsp;<br>• Boosted the safety culture by establishing hazard recognition targets resulting in an 85% increase in hazards reported and fixed.&nbsp;<br>• Coordinated with construction team for the safe and reliable handover of 5 wind farms (1.25 GWs).</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Director, Wind Operation &amp; Maintenance ... (Jan-2021 to Sep-2022)</h6>\n                            </a>\n\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    The Wind Operations &amp; Maintenance organization was responsible for managing 6.3 GW of installed wind capacity within the United States and Canada, ensuring safe and profitable operations while maintaining regulatory compliance. As Director, I led an 80-person team, including region managers, site managers, and technicians, responsible for managing Enel's 3.0 GW wind fleet across 17 wind farms in the US and Canada. This role involved overseeing $200 million in energy sales revenue, $20 million in services revenue, and a budget of $122 million.<br><br>•\tImplemented cost control initiatives optimizing operational processes, achieving an 8% reduction in costs.\n<br>•\tNegotiated end-of-warranty agreements, mitigating business risks by 65%.\n<br>• Enhanced the safety culture by establishing hazard recognition targets and lessons learned protocol resulting in a 25% increase in hazards reported and fixed. <br>• Implemented structured approach to fault reduction and return to service improving issue resolution.<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Why Mobirise?</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Key differences from traditional builders:<br>* Minimalistic, extremely\n                                    <strong>easy-to-use</strong> interface<br>* <strong>Mobile</strong>-friendliness,\n                                    latest website blocks and techniques \"out-the-box\"<br>* <strong>Free</strong> for\n                                    commercial and non-profit use</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">What is Mobirise?</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna\n                                    vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus\n                                    convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis,\n                                    sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Why Mobirise?</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna\n                                    vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus\n                                    convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis,\n                                    sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 5\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse6\">\n                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">What is Mobirise Code Editor?\n                                </h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse6\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna\n                                    vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus\n                                    convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis,\n                                    sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uoLIncnhVR",
