          "_name": "content17",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"content17\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background':bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\" selected>1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-head align-center\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><a href=\"https://www.acciona.us/?_adin=132415900\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Acciona Energy North America</a></h3>\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mb-0 mt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">Dec-2009 to Apr-2014</h4>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"bootstrap-toggle\" class=\"toggle-panel accordionStyles tab-content mt-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    Director, Operation &amp; Maintenance ... (Dec-2009 to Apr-2014)</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">The Operations &amp; Maintenance organization was responsible for managing 0.73 GW of installed wind capacity within the United States and Canada, ensuring safe and profitable operations while maintaining regulatory compliance. As Director, I led a 40-person team, including operations managers, technical support, operational excellence, site managers, and technicians, responsible for managing the fleet across 9 wind farms. This role involved overseeing $100 million in energy sales revenue, $15 million in services revenue, and a budget of $49 million.<br><br>•\tEmpowered organization by improving visibility through monthly financial reviews, resulting in total cash flow reduction of 15% relative to budget. <br>•\tEstablished daily, weekly and monthly operating rhythm and communications resulting in an increase in availability, reduction in return to service, and improved fleet performance.\n<br>•\tEstablished a technician development structure with levels of competency aligned to compensation, improving tech retention.<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Director, Wind Operation &amp; Maintenance ... (Jan-2021 to Sep-2022)</h6>\n                            </a>\n\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    The company owns over 7.5GW of installed wind capacity in North America, with 54 GW globally. The company is playing a key role in the energy transition as one of the world’s leading renewable energy companies. Led the Wind O&amp;M North Zone team in the operations, maintenance, and optimization of the 3.0 GW of wind farms and ensuring safe profitable production within regulatory guidelines.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Why Mobirise?</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Key differences from traditional builders:<br>* Minimalistic, extremely\n                                    <strong>easy-to-use</strong> interface<br>* <strong>Mobile</strong>-friendliness,\n                                    latest website blocks and techniques \"out-the-box\"<br>* <strong>Free</strong> for\n                                    commercial and non-profit use</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">What is Mobirise?</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna\n                                    vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus\n                                    convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis,\n                                    sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Why Mobirise?</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna\n                                    vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus\n                                    convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis,\n                                    sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 5\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse6\">\n                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">What is Mobirise Code Editor?\n                                </h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse6\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna\n                                    vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus\n                                    convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis,\n                                    sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content17-1z",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_cid": "uoLPJBeLS0",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "position": "relative",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".card .card-header": {
              "background-color": "transparent",
              "margin-bottom": "0"
            },
            "a.panel-title": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "&:focus": {
                "text-decoration": "none !important"
              }
            },
            "h6": {
              "font-weight": "700",
              "margin-bottom": "0"
            },
            ".mbr-iconfont": {
              "padding-right": "1rem",
              "font-family": "'Moririse2' !important",
              "font-size": "1.4rem !important",
              "color": "@primaryColor"
            },
            "H3": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            "H4": {
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content17",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"content17\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background':bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\" selected>6</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-head align-center\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><a href=\"https://www.gevernova.com/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">GE Energy (GE Vernova)</a></h3>\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mb-0 mt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">Aug-1999 to Dec-2009</h4>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"bootstrap-toggle\" class=\"toggle-panel accordionStyles tab-content mt-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    Manager, Services Fulfillment ... (Feb-2009 to Dec-2009)</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">As Manager, Service Fulfillment, I was responsible for evaluating GE Wind Services business and establishing a strategy for profitability, establishing commercial strategies relative to service offerings, develops and manages strategically important third-party relationships. This included review of current competencies, establishing plan to fill gaps, and structure of business.<br><br>•\tEstablished Service Strategy for new country entry into Brazil.<br>•\tEstablished process for commercialization of new offerings and worked closely with commercial team to determine how offering would be fulfilled.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Manager, Global Warranty &amp; Customer Management ... (Aug-2006 to Feb-2009)</h6>\n                            </a>\n\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">As the Manager, Global Warranty and Customer Manager, I was responsible for day-to-day operations and management of three global GE Wind Product Warranty teams located in the US, Germany, Spain, and Asia. This included Warranty Management team of 9 people responsible for timely review and disposition of all claims related to product quality and Customer Manager team of 12 senior people responsible for customer claim and issue resolution and the Contract Management team consisting of 3 people that provide detailed reviews and contract analysis. Also, responsible for escalation of issues, communicating risk to the business, and customer interactions, responsiveness, and negotiations of large claims.<br><br>•\tReduced overall product quality cost by 10% by establishing process around evaluation and approval related to contractual obligations and feedback mechanisms into engineering for early notification\n<br>• Increased customer responsiveness by establishing a team and processes focused on customer issue resolution, reducing cycle time by 75%.<br>•\tActing Manager, Product Service and Warranty, I established strategy for Global Product Service group receiving an award for establishment of the strategy for the Product Service group, which included increasing the headcount by 100% to account for growth. I received an award for the establishment of that organization&nbsp;<br> </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Resource Director ... (Nov-2004 to Aug-2006)</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">As Resource Director for the Industrial Installation and Field Services organization, I was responsible for managing and overseeing the day-to-day operations of 12 senior field engineers. This included managing Time and Material job quoting, negotiating contracts, maximizing assigned time, providing 24/7 customer support, resolving receivable issues, controlling costs, and communicating key business metrics.<br><br>•\tIncreased field engineer billable time 6% increasing revenue $17K per field engineer per year.\n<br>•\tIntegrated two organizations simplifying workflow and reducing head count needs resulting in an annual $150K savings to the business.\n<br>•\tContinually chosen to lead cross functional teams during complex business changes&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><p><b>Resource Manager ... (Feb-2003 to Nov-2004)</b></p></h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">As Resource Manager for GE Industrial Services, I was responsible for the day-to-day operations of three districts (11 states). This included managing Time and Material job quoting, negotiating contracts, ensuring profitability, maximizing the utilization of 60 field engineers, staffing all jobs within the districts, providing 24/7 customer support, resolving receivable issues, controlling costs, and communicating key business metrics.<br><br>•\tDecreased financial system rollout impact by leading department wide team in process development and training.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>•\tDecreased billing issues, rework, and increased revenue during financial system roll-out.&nbsp;<br>•\tTrained 13 operations personnel and 120 field engineers, on new financial system, remotely reducing training costs by $40K.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Service Manager ... (Feb-2001 to Feb-2003)</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">GE Digital Energy developed a high-quality and reliable, modular, power backup system for data centers. As Service Manager, I was responsible for establishing and leading the service business for this product, including overseeing the installation, commissioning, and ongoing operations of the backup systems.<br><br>•\tInstalled and commissioned the first of a new product 18% below budget and 2 weeks early in a 3-month program.<br>•\tInitiated product fulfillment metrics and process changes which decreased delivery issues by 10% in 6 months \n<br>• Standardized installation and commissioning processes, resulted in a decreased installation time and reduced commissioning issues. &nbsp;<br>• Created the service's processes and metrics to support the organization's objectives. \n<br>• Performed additional business roles such as quoting, engineering, marketing, and aftermarket customer support.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 5\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse6\">\n                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Six-Sigma Black Belt ... (Nov-1999 to Feb-2001)</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse6\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">As a Six Sigma Black Belt for GE Power Systems, I was responsible for managing the Six Sigma Quality program. This included defining project goals, establishing key business metrics, providing relevant training, monitoring customer responsiveness metrics, and making recommendations for process and metric improvements.<br>\n<br>•\tCertified Black Belt.<br>•\tMentored closure of 140 six-sigma projects resulting in $3.0M savings during one-year period.<br>•\tTrained 68 in GE's Six Sigma methodology (DMAIC and DFSS) achieving 100% six-sigma training status.<br>•\tD11 Steam Turbine Program manager responsible for managing the program and customer communications.<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
