          "_name": "content17",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"content17\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background':bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-head align-center\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><a href=\"https://www.navy.com/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">US Navy Nuclear Program</a></h3>\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mb-0 mt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">Jun-1987 to Jun-1996</h4>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"bootstrap-toggle\" class=\"toggle-panel accordionStyles tab-content mt-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Navy Nuclear Plant Training Unit Trainer ... (Dec-1992 to Jun-1996)</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    As Supervisor of the plant operations team, I ensured the plant operated in accordance with strict standards. This included training 150 staff operators in operations and maintenance procedures and training student officers to lead the plant's operating personnel.<br><br>• First enlisted qualified as engineering officer of the watch coming out of a refueling overhaul, role usually reserved for officers. <br>• Selected by staff training group as the only enlisted engineering officer of the watch to lead the operations team in an operational reactor safeguards exam.<br> •\tReceived Letter of Commendation, and the Navy Achievement Medal.\n<br>•\tTop staff electrical training instructor at Nuclear Power Training facility&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Submarine Nuclear Plant Supervisor/Operator ... (Apr-1989 to Dec-1992)</h6>\n                            </a>\n\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">As a Nuclear Electrician's Mate assigned to a Los Angeles-class submarine based in Pearl Harbor, Hawaii, I was responsible for the operation and maintenance of the ship's electrical power generation systems, lighting systems, electrical equipment, and appliances.<br><br>•\tQualified engineering watch supervisor and engineering duty petty officer in short period following overhaul.<br>• Executed a full battery system change out on-schedule and under budget with no safety events.<br>•\tReceived Letter of Commendation, and two Letters of Appreciation.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Navy Nuclear Power Training Unit ... (Jun-1987 to Apr-1989)</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">Graduated Navy Nuclear Power training program.<br><br>• Navy Electricians Mate \"A\" school in Orlando, FL<br>• Navy Nuclear Power Training school in Orlando, FL<br>• Navy Prototype Training Unit in Idaho Falls, ID<br><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n                                <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">What is Mobirise?</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna\n                                    vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus\n                                    convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis,\n                                    sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Why Mobirise?</h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna\n                                    vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus\n                                    convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis,\n                                    sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card mb-3\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 5\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse6\">\n                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down mobi-mbri inactive\"></span>\n                                <h6 class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">What is Mobirise Code Editor?\n                                </h6>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse6\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body p-3\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">\n                                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur in nulla ut magna\n                                    vehicula libero luctus in ipsum consequat faucibus. Ut porta nulla ac dapibus\n                                    convallis. Curabitur sit amet massa quam. In ut ex auctor, porta neque quis,\n                                    sagittis purus. Nunc auctor gravida magna, sed efficitur tortor tristique quis.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content17-23",
